Remotion
--------

  skills/remotion-*/               Copyright (c) Remotion (https://www.remotion.dev)
      The official Remotion agent skills, copied unchanged (skills version
      4.0.506). Upstream: https://github.com/remotion-dev/skills, generated
      from packages/skills of https://github.com/remotion-dev/remotion. The
      upstream skills repository ships no licence file of its own; the
      licence of the Remotion monorepo is reproduced verbatim in
      vendor/remotion/LICENSE.md. The MIT grant of this repository does NOT
      apply to these directories.

  Remotion itself (the npm packages that `npm install` fetches for the
  templates) is not vendored here. It is distributed under the Remotion
  License: free for individuals, for-profit organisations with up to 3
  employees and non-profits; other companies need a Company License
  (https://www.remotion.pro/license).

Fonts, footage, logos
---------------------

  None are bundled. skills/video-editor/scripts/fetch_fonts.py downloads free
  (OFL) fonts on your machine; every job brings its own licensed fonts, media
  and brand assets.
